  "chain": "relay design/installation flaw [cause B: trip-sensitive relay mounted on switchgear cubicle door] -> door mechanically agitated during clearance/tagging activities -> relay contacts inadvertently closed -> 13kV breaker tripped open -> 11 13kV bus, U-4000-11/12/13 transformers, and 11/21 4kV busses de-energized -> 1A and 2A EDGs auto-started (no adverse safety consequence; all systems functioned as designed)",
