  ],
  "notes": "Event affects both Unit 1 (Mode 5) and Unit 2 (Mode 1); LER filed under Unit 1 docket 05000317 per FORM-366 fields. Component identified in Section H as 'High Speed Tripping Relay 1RY294/B-11-B', IEEE function ID 94, system ID EA. No PART_OF edges asserted since narrative describes functional/power relationships (breaker feeding buses/transformers), not explicit containment, except the relay-on-breaker-cabinet-door relationship which is spatial/mounting rather than a stated subcomponent relationship, so not modeled as PART_OF per rule 7. No BACKED_UP_BY edges - EDGs are the direct automatic response, not backups per rule 6's stricter operability-during-event language, and are represented as components within the consequence chain rather than backup systems."
